    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d577-a1">

                <pb facs="0683" n="587" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg587"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Facio to Mr.
                            Merry.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Republic of
                            Costa Rica,<lb/>Department of Foreign Relations</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName><placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#italic">National
                                    Palace</hi></placeName>, <placeName type="city"><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">San José</hi></placeName></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1899-09-27"><hi rendition="#italic">September
                                27, 1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: Explaining the uncertainty that
                    yesterday your excellency was pleased to express verbally to me, I have the
                    honor to declare to you that the rights of the law No. 40, of June 20, 1896,
                    apply to North American citizens residing in Costa Rica in the same degree as
                    [they do] to the natives of this country; as also, by effect of the decree No.
                    6, of August 26 of this year, said rights are likewise extended to the North
                    American citizens resident outside of Costa Rica, on condition that the
                    Government of your excellency makes equal concession to the Costa Rican citizens
                    that do not reside in the United States.</p>
                <p>With this explanation I hope to meet the wishes of your excellency; and I am
                    pleased to subscribe myself, with the most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Justo A. Facio.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
